# AI System Design Coach

An AI-powered backend application that simulates system design interviews, evaluates candidate answers using Gemini, and stores interview history for future analysis.

## Features

### Interview Management

* Create interview sessions
* Track interview topics
* Persist interview history

### Question & Answer Management

* Store system design questions
* Store candidate answers
* Associate questions with interview sessions

### AI Evaluation

* Evaluate answers using Gemini
* Generate structured feedback
* Provide scores, strengths, missing points, and next steps

### Persistence

* PostgreSQL database
* Hibernate/JPA entity mapping
* Repository pattern for data access

---

## Tech Stack

### Backend

* Java 21
* Spring Boot
* Spring Data JPA
* Hibernate

### Database

* PostgreSQL

### AI

* Gemini API

### Build Tool

* Maven

---

## Architecture

```text
Controller
    ↓
Service
    ↓
Repository
    ↓
PostgreSQL
```

### Components

```text
InterviewController
EvaluationController

InterviewService
GeminiService

InterviewSessionRepository
QuestionAnswerRepository
EvaluationRepository
```

---

## Database Design

### InterviewSession

```text
id
topic
created_at
```

### QuestionAnswer

```text
id
question
answer
interview_session_id
```

### Evaluation

```text
id
score
strengths
missing_points
next_steps
question_answer_id
```

### Relationships

```text
InterviewSession
       |
       | 1
       |
       | *
QuestionAnswer
       |
       | 1
       |
       | 1
Evaluation
```

---

## API Endpoints

### Create Interview

```http
POST /api/interviews/createInterview
```

Request

```json
{
  "topic": "Distributed Cache"
}
```

---

### Add Question & Answer

```http
POST /api/interviews/{interviewId}/questions
```

Request

```json
{
  "question": "Design Redis",
  "answer": "Use replication"
}
```

---

### Evaluate Answer

```http
POST /api/evaluations/{questionAnswerId}
```

Generates AI feedback and stores the evaluation.

---

## Evaluation Flow

```text
QuestionAnswer
        ↓
Gemini Service
        ↓
Gemini API
        ↓
Evaluation Result
        ↓
Evaluation Entity
        ↓
PostgreSQL
```

